[22.1659, "o", "## Per PR\r\n"]
[22.1659, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "- **#17372** (examples catalog): BLOCKED on a docs-codeowner review. CI green at 143c6e4. All 14 \r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "threads resolved. No human reviews.\r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "- **#18618** (Slime e2e test, WIP): CI green at fac7593. Five unresolved threads, none from \r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "CodeRabbit; see item 1.\r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "- **#18619** (verl docs): CI green at 93afb6b. Two CodeRabbit threads open; see items 2 and 3. No \r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "activity for 3.8 days. Pinged Nov 13, so no new ping.\r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.166, "o", "**CI:** all required checks pass on every head. No failures to diagnose.\r\n"]
